d", "contents": [{"content": "tenir ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "g\u00e9rer, diriger un \u00e9tablissement", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ceux qui tiennent le restaurant sont de Rome. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le01ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le panini", "type": "name"}, {"content": "sandwich chaud fait avec du pain italien", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ils font de bons paninis !", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn3le01ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "frn3le01ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Les consonnes finales muettes", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Beaucoup de mots se terminent par une consonne qui ne se prononce pas. Il en existe 14. Les plus courantes sont : <span class=\"strong\">s, t, d, x</span>. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Dans certains cas, les consonnes <span class=\"strong\">c, r, f, l</span> ne se prononcent pas en position finale. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "beaucoup", "type": "example"}, {"content": "prix", "type": "example"}, {"content": "nez", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Exceptions</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Exemples</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"On ne prononce pas le <span class=\\\"strong\\\">c</span>  quand le mot se termine par -<span class=\\\"strong\\\">anc</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"blanc<br/>banc\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"On prononce le <span class=\\\"strong\\\">r</span> dans les mots monosyllabiques \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hier<br/>mer\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"On prononce le <span class=\\\"strong\\\">f</span> dans tous les adjectifs qui se terminent en <span class=\\\"strong\\\">f</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"neuf\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"On ne prononce pas le <span class=\\\"strong\\\">l</span> dans tous les mots qui se terminent par v + -<span class=\\\"strong\\\">eil</span> ou -<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ail</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"travail<br/>r\u00e9veil\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "On ne prononce pas la consonne des mots qui se terminent par : <span class=\"strong\">b, g, h, p, w, z</span>. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "dos", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Remarque : Certains mots peuvent \u00eatre prononc\u00e9s de diff\u00e9rentes mani\u00e8res. Par exemple, avec le mot <span class=\"strong\">ao\u00fbt</span>, certaines personnes prononcent le <span class=\"strong\">t</span> \u00e0 la fin, d'autres pas. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "La prononciation ou pas du <span class=\"strong\">s</span> \u00e0 la fin de <span class=\"strong\">plus</span> d\u00e9pend de son utilisation. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Cas o\u00f9 on prononce</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Cas o\u00f9 on ne prononce pas</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"dans l'expression <span class=\\\"strong\\\">plus de</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"dans l'expression <span class=\\\"strong\\\">ne... plus</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"devant un mot qui commence par une voyelle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"devant un mot qui commence par une consonne\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pour le signe (+) en math\u00e9matique\\\"}\",\"\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Il est plus grand que moi. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Ce restaurant est plus original. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Choisissez votre restaurant pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez l'adresse du restaurant. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez votre plat pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez le plat que vous n'aimez pas. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Partagez vos r\u00e9ponses avec votre camarade. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Nom du restaurant</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br/><br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Lieu : \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br/><br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Plat pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9 : \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br/><br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Plat que j'aime le moins :\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br/><br/>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "J'\u00e9cris l'adresse de mon restaurant pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'\u00e9cris le nom de mon plat pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je partage mes r\u00e9ponses avec mon camarade. ", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "typ